1
00:00:02,761 --> 00:00:04,241
I'm Peppa Pig

2
00:00:04,882 --> 00:00:07,101
and this is my little brother, George

3
00:00:07,523 --> 00:00:09,083
This is Mummy Pig

4
00:00:09,804 --> 00:00:11,244
and this is Daddy Pig

5
00:00:13,566 --> 00:00:14,846
I'm Peppa Pig!

6
00:00:17,447 --> 00:00:19,008
"The Time Capsule"

7
00:00:20,248 --> 00:00:22,529
Peppa and her friends are at playgroup

8
00:00:22,569 --> 00:00:26,080
Today, they are making a time capsule

9
00:00:26,651 --> 00:00:28,411
What's a time capsule?

10
00:00:28,451 --> 00:00:32,492
A time capsule is something that tells people in the future

11
00:00:32,532 --> 00:00:34,815
how we live today

12
00:00:34,855 --> 00:00:35,773
Pardon?

13
00:00:35,813 --> 00:00:38,185
We put special things in a bucket

14
00:00:38,225 --> 00:00:41,676
Then we bury it in the school garden

15
00:00:41,974 --> 00:00:43,694
Will it grow?

16
00:00:44,511 --> 00:00:45,658
No, Suzy

17
00:00:45,698 --> 00:00:49,101
The bucket will stay underground for many years

18
00:00:51,293 --> 00:00:54,651
Now, what should we put inside?

19
00:00:54,696 --> 00:00:55,863
A comic book

20
00:00:55,904 --> 00:00:57,749
Very good, Peppa

21
00:00:58,850 --> 00:00:59,850
Music

22
00:01:00,250 --> 00:01:02,088
Very good, Suzy

23
00:01:02,890 --> 00:01:03,810
A toy

24
00:01:04,410 --> 00:01:05,410
Coins

25
00:01:06,176 --> 00:01:07,136
Stamps

26
00:01:08,210 --> 00:01:09,250
A carrot

27
00:01:10,809 --> 00:01:12,625
You really like carrots

28
00:01:12,665 --> 00:01:13,889
don't you, Rebecca?

29
00:01:13,929 --> 00:01:14,609
Yes

30
00:01:16,690 --> 00:01:17,810
The things in this bucket

31
00:01:17,850 --> 00:01:21,229
show what our everyday life is like

32
00:01:21,350 --> 00:01:22,750
Madame Gazelle

33
00:01:22,803 --> 00:01:25,156
I wonder what the future will be like?

34
00:01:25,197 --> 00:01:27,097
Well, what do you think it will be like?

35
00:01:27,341 --> 00:01:31,141
I think in the future, I will live on the Moon

36
00:01:33,383 --> 00:01:36,756
and all my friends will come visit me on the Moon

37
00:01:40,335 --> 00:01:42,815
And I will fly a space rocket in the future

38
00:01:43,288 --> 00:01:44,288
Okay?

39
00:01:51,960 --> 00:01:56,013
Now we will record a message for the people of the future

40
00:01:56,493 --> 00:01:59,099
Everyone, say hello to the future

41
00:01:59,140 --> 00:02:01,053
Hello, future, how are you?

42
00:02:01,454 --> 00:02:04,614
I think you might be living on the Moon now

43
00:02:04,654 --> 00:02:06,934
and going on holiday to Mars

44
00:02:07,114 --> 00:02:09,875
and zooming around in rockets, too!

45
00:02:12,775 --> 00:02:14,062
Very good

46
00:02:16,857 --> 00:02:18,334
It's almost time to go home

47
00:02:18,374 --> 00:02:19,900
All the parents have arrived

48
00:02:20,526 --> 00:02:23,905
Mummy, Daddy, we made a time capsule!

49
00:02:24,052 --> 00:02:26,469
Daddy Pig, you're just in time

50
00:02:26,509 --> 00:02:28,107
Could you dig a hole for us?

51
00:02:28,191 --> 00:02:29,546
Of course!

52
00:02:33,298 --> 00:02:36,025
Daddy Pig has dug a hole in the school garden

53
00:02:36,121 --> 00:02:37,730
to put the time capsule in

54
00:02:41,175 --> 00:02:42,162
All done

55
00:02:42,977 --> 00:02:44,910
Can we dig it up now?

56
00:02:45,410 --> 00:02:47,519
It will stay underground

57
00:02:47,605 --> 00:02:49,949
for many, many years

58
00:02:50,755 --> 00:02:52,958
But I can't wait that long

59
00:02:52,999 --> 00:02:53,683
Peppa

60
00:02:53,724 --> 00:02:56,613
you're just like your daddy when he was little

61
00:02:56,653 --> 00:02:57,732
Really?

62
00:02:57,773 --> 00:03:01,494
Yes, I remember when I was his teacher too

63
00:03:01,534 --> 00:03:03,297
You taught my daddy?

64
00:03:03,337 --> 00:03:06,663
Yes, I taught all your daddies and mummies

65
00:03:06,703 --> 00:03:07,504
Did you?

66
00:03:07,544 --> 00:03:09,386
- Yes, Madame Gazelle
- Yes, Madame Gazelle

67
00:03:10,274 --> 00:03:12,472
When your daddies and mummies were young

68
00:03:12,512 --> 00:03:14,796
They made a time capsule too

69
00:03:14,836 --> 00:03:15,996
Yes, that's right

70
00:03:16,036 --> 00:03:18,116
We buried it next to a little tree

71
00:03:18,156 --> 00:03:19,556
Can we dig it up?

72
00:03:19,596 --> 00:03:20,436
Yes

73
00:03:20,516 --> 00:03:23,116
I think we buried it here

74
00:03:24,037 --> 00:03:26,325
I thought it was a very small tree

75
00:03:26,885 --> 00:03:29,041
That was a long time ago

76
00:03:29,082 --> 00:03:31,237
The tree is much bigger now

77
00:03:36,234 --> 00:03:38,277
Look, I've found something

78
00:03:38,519 --> 00:03:40,363
It's our old time capsule

79
00:03:40,404 --> 00:03:41,903
- Hooray!
- Hooray!

80
00:03:42,008 --> 00:03:43,935
I can't wait to see inside

81
00:03:45,256 --> 00:03:47,010
All right, everyone, stand back

82
00:03:47,050 --> 00:03:49,189
- Yes, Madame Gazelle
- Yes, Madame Gazelle

83
00:03:49,843 --> 00:03:52,041
What do we have here?

84
00:03:52,761 --> 00:03:54,281
An old comic book

85
00:03:54,321 --> 00:03:56,241
It's my favourite comic book!

86
00:03:56,281 --> 00:03:57,785
A tin toy

87
00:03:57,825 --> 00:03:59,401
It's my favourite toy!

88
00:03:59,441 --> 00:04:00,543
A record

89
00:04:00,681 --> 00:04:02,521
It's my favourite record!

90
00:04:02,561 --> 00:04:05,201
And a very old carrot

91
00:04:05,241 --> 00:04:06,331
That's mine

92
00:04:06,371 --> 00:04:08,121
Good choice, Mummy

93
00:04:10,401 --> 00:04:14,801
And a videotape of your daddies and mummies
when they were little

94
00:04:18,867 --> 00:04:21,448
Who is that little pig wearing glasses?

95
00:04:21,488 --> 00:04:23,608
Oh, that's Daddy

96
00:04:24,291 --> 00:04:25,342
That's me

97
00:04:25,382 --> 00:04:26,894
Hello, future!

98
00:04:28,537 --> 00:04:30,980
Your voice was so squeaky when you were little!

99
00:04:32,241 --> 00:04:34,661
You probably live on the Moon now

100
00:04:35,718 --> 00:04:37,841
Daddy was so silly when he was little!

101
00:04:39,509 --> 00:04:41,457
Making a time capsule is so much fun

102
00:04:42,490 --> 00:04:44,823
But finding a time capsule is even more fun!
